#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Taxpayer DNI/NIE for `aeat config auth configure --provider clave_movil`. "
"Used to stamp the persisted session with the operator's identity and to pre-"
"fill the non-QR fallback form. AEAT-regulated personal identifier under "
"Spanish tax law; typed as SecretStr to prevent leakage through repr / "
"model_dump / ValidationError."
msgstr ""
"DNI/NIE del contribuyente para `aeat config auth configure --provider "
"clave_movil`. Se usa para sellar la sesión persistida con la identidad del "
"operador y para rellenar previamente el formulario de reserva sin QR. "
"Identificador personal regulado por la AEAT según la normativa tributaria "
"española; tipado como SecretStr para evitar filtraciones a través de repr / "
"model_dump / ValidationError."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_MOVIL_NIE_SOPORTE`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_MOVIL_NIE_SOPORTE`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"NIE support number (número de soporte) used by the non-QR Cl@ve Móvil "
"fallback form. Applies when the configured identity is a NIE. AEAT-regulated"
" personal identifier; typed as SecretStr to prevent leakage."
msgstr ""
"Número de soporte del NIE que usa el formulario de reserva sin QR de Cl@ve "
"Móvil. Se aplica cuando la identidad configurada es un NIE. Identificador "
"personal regulado por la AEAT; tipado como SecretStr para evitar "
"filtraciones."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_MOVIL_TIMEOUT_MS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_MOVIL_TIMEOUT_MS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`120000`"
msgstr "`120000`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Maximum time (milliseconds) the Cl@ve Móvil provider waits for AEAT browser-"
"side authentication completion before aborting. Production runs must fail "
"fast enough for an operator to retry deliberately rather than leaving a "
"pending request dangling."
msgstr ""
"Tiempo máximo (milisegundos) que el proveedor de Cl@ve Móvil espera a que se"
" complete la autenticación del lado del navegador de la AEAT antes de "
"abortar. Las ejecuciones en producción deben fallar con la suficiente "
"rapidez para que un operador reintente de forma deliberada en lugar de dejar"
" una petición pendiente colgada."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PERMANENTE_DNI_NIE`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PERMANENTE_DNI_NIE`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Taxpayer DNI/NIE for `aeat config auth configure --provider "
"clave_permanente`. Used as the Cl@ve IdP login username and to stamp the "
"persisted session with the operator's identity. AEAT-regulated personal "
"identifier under Spanish tax law; typed as SecretStr to prevent leakage "
"through repr / model_dump / ValidationError."
msgstr ""
"DNI/NIE del contribuyente para `aeat config auth configure --provider "
"clave_permanente`. Se usa como nombre de usuario de acceso del IdP de Cl@ve "
"y para sellar la sesión persistida con la identidad del operador. "
"Identificador personal regulado por la AEAT según la normativa tributaria "
"española; tipado como SecretStr para evitar filtraciones a través de repr / "
"model_dump / ValidationError."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PERMANENTE_PASSWORD`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PERMANENTE_PASSWORD`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Cl@ve Permanente password for the DNI/NIE + password login form. Same "
"treatment as the certificate passphrase: env var only, never stored in a "
"committed env file, never logged."
msgstr ""
"Contraseña de Cl@ve Permanente para el formulario de acceso con DNI/NIE + "
"contraseña. Mismo tratamiento que la frase de contraseña del certificado: "
"solo por variable de entorno, nunca se almacena en un fichero de entorno "
"confirmado, nunca se registra."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PERMANENTE_TIMEOUT_MS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PERMANENTE_TIMEOUT_MS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`60000`"
msgstr "`60000`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Maximum time (milliseconds) the Cl@ve Permanente provider waits for the "
"AEAT/Cl@ve IdP login form round-trip to complete before aborting. Routine "
"Cl@ve Permanente login is headless-automatable (DNI/NIE + password, no SMS),"
" so this window is shorter than the human-in-the-loop Cl@ve Móvil timeout."
msgstr ""
"Tiempo máximo (milisegundos) que el proveedor de Cl@ve Permanente espera a "
"que se complete el ida y vuelta del formulario de acceso del IdP de "
"AEAT/Cl@ve antes de abortar. El acceso rutinario con Cl@ve Permanente es "
"automatizable en modo headless (DNI/NIE + contraseña, sin SMS), así que esta"
" ventana es más corta que el tiempo de espera de Cl@ve Móvil con "
"intervención humana."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PREFER_NON_QR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLAVE_PREFER_NON_QR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`false`"
msgstr "`false`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"When true, the Cl@ve Móvil provider uses the non-QR fallback (DNI/NIE + "
"contraste) rather than the QR code. This still requires operator-mediated "
"completion in Cl@ve."
msgstr ""
"Cuando es true, el proveedor de Cl@ve Móvil usa la reserva sin QR (DNI/NIE +"
" contraste) en lugar del código QR. Esto sigue requiriendo que el operador "
"complete el proceso en Cl@ve."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CLI_REVEAL_IDENTIFIERS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CLI_REVEAL_IDENTIFIERS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Reveal raw profile and bucket identifiers in CLI success output instead of "
"the paste-safe ``<profile-id>`` / ``<bucket-id>`` placeholders. Default off "
"keeps the centralised-output-redaction policy (profile/bucket UUIDs are "
"redacted so diagnostics are safe to paste into shared notes). A multi-client"
" gestor who must disambiguate which bucket a command addressed sets "
"``CADRUMO_CLI_REVEAL_IDENTIFIERS=1`` to opt out. This only un-redacts the "
"opaque profile/bucket UUIDs; NIF/NIE/CIF tax identities, bearer tokens, "
"URLs, and secure-object keys stay redacted unconditionally."
msgstr ""
"Revela los identificadores en bruto de perfil y de bucket en la salida de "
"éxito de la CLI en lugar de los marcadores seguros para pegar ``<profile-"
"id>`` / ``<bucket-id>``. Estar desactivado por defecto mantiene la política "
"centralizada de redacción de la salida (los UUID de perfil/bucket se "
"redactan para que los diagnósticos se puedan pegar sin riesgo en notas "
"compartidas). Un gestor con varios clientes que necesite distinguir a qué "
"bucket se dirigió un comando fija ``CADRUMO_CLI_REVEAL_IDENTIFIERS=1`` para "
"excluirse. Esto solo revela los UUID opacos de perfil/bucket; las "
"identidades fiscales NIF/NIE/CIF, los tokens de portador, las URL y las "
"claves de objetos seguros permanecen redactadas incondicionalmente."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_CORPUS_TEXT_CACHE_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_CORPUS_TEXT_CACHE_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Directory for the registry corpus source-text validation cache (normalised "
"text keyed by content fingerprint)"
msgstr ""
"Directorio de la caché de validación del texto de origen del corpus del "
"registro (texto normalizado indexado por huella de contenido)"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_DATABASE_URL`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_DATABASE_URL`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"SQLAlchemy URL for the primary persistence backend. When empty, the model "
"validator resolves the URL through the active-profile precedence chain to "
"``sqlite:///<cadrumo_local_storage_root>/buckets/<bucket-"
"id>/db/cadrumo.db``; with no active profile it derives a root-level fallback"
" at ``sqlite:///<cadrumo_local_storage_root>/cadrumo.db`` so the URL is "
"never empty when the storage root is set. Tests that need a deterministic "
"location supply this field explicitly; production reads the computed value."
msgstr ""
"URL de SQLAlchemy para el backend de persistencia principal. Cuando está "
"vacía, el validador del modelo resuelve la URL a través de la cadena de "
"precedencia del perfil activo a "
"``sqlite:///<cadrumo_local_storage_root>/buckets/<bucket-"
"id>/db/cadrumo.db``; sin perfil activo deriva una reserva de nivel raíz en "
"``sqlite:///<cadrumo_local_storage_root>/cadrumo.db`` para que la URL nunca "
"esté vacía cuando la raíz de almacenamiento está definida. Las pruebas que "
"necesitan una ubicación determinista suministran este campo explícitamente; "
"la producción lee el valor calculado."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_DEADLINE_DUE_SOON_DAYS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_DEADLINE_DUE_SOON_DAYS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Days before an obligation's closes_on date that flag "
"ObligationStatus.DUE_SOON in the deadline engine"
msgstr ""
"Días antes de la fecha closes_on de una obligación que marcan "
"ObligationStatus.DUE_SOON en el motor de plazos"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_DEV_TEST_DATABASE_PASSWORD`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_DEV_TEST_DATABASE_PASSWORD`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Development/test-only password used by secure-storage subprocess tests."
msgstr ""
"Contraseña solo para desarrollo/pruebas que usan las pruebas de subproceso "
"del almacenamiento seguro."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_DRAFT_FAIL_ON_WARNING`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_DRAFT_FAIL_ON_WARNING`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"If true, build_draft raises FilingValidationError when any WARNING- or "
"ERROR-severity finding is produced"
msgstr ""
"Si es true, build_draft lanza FilingValidationError cuando se produce "
"cualquier hallazgo de severidad WARNING o ERROR"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_DRAFTS_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_DRAFTS_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where filing drafts are written as JSON files"
msgstr ""
"Directorio donde los borradores de presentación se escriben como ficheros "
"JSON"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_EVIDENCE_CLOUD_UPLOAD_PERMITTED`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_EVIDENCE_CLOUD_UPLOAD_PERMITTED`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Whether this deployment permits transmitting evidence to a cloud model at "
"all. Default off: evidence reading is on-host only. When True, a per-"
"invocation operator consent acknowledgement is still required for each cloud"
" read."
msgstr ""
"Si este despliegue permite en absoluto transmitir evidencia a un modelo en "
"la nube. Desactivado por defecto: la lectura de evidencia es solo en el "
"propio equipo. Cuando es True, sigue siendo necesario un reconocimiento de "
"consentimiento del operador por cada invocación para cada lectura en la "
"nube."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_EVIDENCE_GESTOR_MODE`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_EVIDENCE_GESTOR_MODE`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Gestor/professional deployment flag. When True, cloud evidence upload is "
"categorically refused regardless of cadrumo_evidence_cloud_upload_permitted "
"or per-invocation consent."
msgstr ""
"Indicador de despliegue para gestor/profesional. Cuando es True, la subida "
"de evidencia a la nube se rechaza de forma categórica con independencia de "
"cadrumo_evidence_cloud_upload_permitted o del consentimiento por invocación."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FALLBACK_LANGUAGES`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FALLBACK_LANGUAGES`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`es,en`"
msgstr "`es,en`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Comma-separated fallback chain consulted when the target language is "
"missing."
msgstr ""
"Cadena de reserva separada por comas que se consulta cuando falta el idioma "
"de destino."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FILE_LOCK_RETRY_BACKOFF_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FILE_LOCK_RETRY_BACKOFF_S`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`0.05`"
msgstr "`0.05`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Sleep interval (seconds) between non-blocking file-lock acquire attempts"
msgstr ""
"Intervalo de espera (segundos) entre intentos no bloqueantes de adquisición "
"del bloqueo de fichero"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FILE_LOCK_TIMEOUT_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FILE_LOCK_TIMEOUT_S`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`30.0`"
msgstr "`30.0`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Default exclusive file-lock acquisition timeout (seconds)"
msgstr ""
"Tiempo de espera por defecto para la adquisición del bloqueo exclusivo de "
"fichero (segundos)"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FILING_HISTORY_ARCHIVE_HTML`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FILING_HISTORY_ARCHIVE_HTML`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"If true, archive fetched detail-page HTML under "
"<cadrumo_filing_history_dir>/pages/"
msgstr ""
"Si es true, archiva el HTML de la página de detalle obtenido en "
"<cadrumo_filing_history_dir>/pages/"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FILING_HISTORY_CACHE_TTL_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FILING_HISTORY_CACHE_TTL_S`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"TTL in seconds for per-expediente filing-history cache entries (default 15 "
"min)"
msgstr ""
"TTL en segundos para las entradas de caché del historial de presentaciones "
"por expediente (por defecto 15 min)"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FILING_HISTORY_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FILING_HISTORY_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where the persisted ModeloHistory JSON file lives"
msgstr "Directorio donde reside el fichero JSON persistido de ModeloHistory"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FINANCIAL_TXS_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FINANCIAL_TXS_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where the transaction catalogue JSON file is stored"
msgstr ""
"Directorio donde se almacena el fichero JSON del catálogo de transacciones"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FORCE_COLOR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FORCE_COLOR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Force ANSI colour output even when stdout is not a TTY. Operators set this "
"when piping Cadrumo output through a terminal renderer (less -R, gh actions,"
" etc.). Defaults to False; the should_use_color() helper consults this and "
"the standard NO_COLOR convention through Settings rather than reading "
"os.environ directly."
msgstr ""
"Fuerza la salida de color ANSI incluso cuando stdout no es un TTY. Los "
"operadores lo activan al canalizar la salida de Cadrumo a través de un "
"renderizador de terminal (less -R, gh actions, etc.). Por defecto es False; "
"el ayudante should_use_color() consulta esto y la convención estándar "
"NO_COLOR a través de Settings en lugar de leer os.environ directamente."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_FX_RATE_LOOKUP_TIMEOUT_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_FX_RATE_LOOKUP_TIMEOUT_S`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Timeout (seconds) for one ECB Data Portal euro reference-rate lookup. A "
"ledger import resolves one lookup per distinct currency/date, so this budget"
" bounds a single observation query rather than the whole import."
msgstr ""
"Tiempo de espera (segundos) para una consulta del tipo de cambio de "
"referencia del euro en el ECB Data Portal. Una importación del ledger "
"resuelve una consulta por cada combinación distinta de divisa y fecha, por "
"lo que este presupuesto acota una única consulta de observación, no la "
"importación completa."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ROOT_FOLDER_ID`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ROOT_FOLDER_ID`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Drive folder ID under which `cadrumo-vault/` is created and used. Required "
"when cadrumo_storage_provider_kind=google_drive. Operator obtains this from "
"the Cloud Console / Drive web UI; the app creates `cadrumo-vault/` lazily on"
" first probe."
msgstr ""
"ID de la carpeta de Drive bajo la cual se crea y usa `cadrumo-vault/`. "
"Obligatorio cuando cadrumo_storage_provider_kind=google_drive. El operador "
"lo obtiene de la Cloud Console o de la interfaz web de Drive; la aplicación "
"crea `cadrumo-vault/` de forma diferida en el primer sondeo."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_GOOGLE_DRIVE_VAULT_FOLDER_NAME`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_GOOGLE_DRIVE_VAULT_FOLDER_NAME`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`cadrumo-vault`"
msgstr "`cadrumo-vault`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Folder name created under the Google Drive root for the Cadrumo vault"
msgstr ""
"Nombre de carpeta que se crea bajo la raíz de Google Drive para el vault de "
"Cadrumo"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_GOOGLE_OAUTH_ACCESS_REFRESH_BUFFER_S`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_GOOGLE_OAUTH_ACCESS_REFRESH_BUFFER_S`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`300`"
msgstr "`300`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Clock-skew buffer (seconds) before nominal expiry when refreshing Google "
"access tokens"
msgstr ""
"Margen por desfase de reloj (segundos) antes de la caducidad nominal al "
"renovar los tokens de acceso de Google"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_INBOX_ALERT_LEAD_DAYS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_INBOX_ALERT_LEAD_DAYS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`7`"
msgstr "`7`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Lead window (days) for notification deadline reporting: surface "
"CRITICAL/HIGH notifications whose appeal_deadline falls within the next N "
"days"
msgstr ""
"Ventana de anticipación (días) para el informe de plazos de notificaciones: "
"muestra las notificaciones CRITICAL/HIGH cuyo appeal_deadline cae dentro de "
"los próximos N días"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_INBOX_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_INBOX_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where the persisted Inbox JSON file lives"
msgstr "Directorio donde reside el fichero JSON persistido de Inbox"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_INBOX_PDF_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_INBOX_PDF_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where downloaded notification PDFs are stored"
msgstr "Directorio donde se almacenan los PDF de notificaciones descargados"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_INVOICES_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_INVOICES_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where the invoice catalogue JSON file is stored"
msgstr "Directorio donde se almacena el fichero JSON del catálogo de facturas"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_IVA_CATALOGUE_ROOT`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_IVA_CATALOGUE_ROOT`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Root directory for the hand-reviewed IVA taxonomy catalogue"
msgstr "Directorio raíz del catálogo de taxonomía de IVA revisado a mano"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_JUSTIFICANTE_PARSER_BACKEND`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_JUSTIFICANTE_PARSER_BACKEND`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "JustificanteParserBackendSetting"
msgstr "JustificanteParserBackendSetting"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`pdfplumber`"
msgstr "`pdfplumber`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Parser backend for `cadrumo.adapters.inbound.justificante`"
msgstr "Backend de análisis para `cadrumo.adapters.inbound.justificante`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_JUSTIFICANTES_DIR`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_JUSTIFICANTES_DIR`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "Directory where parsed justificante PDFs and metadata are stored"
msgstr ""
"Directorio donde se almacenan los PDF de justificante analizados y sus "
"metadatos"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_LIBREOFFICE_EXECUTABLE`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_LIBREOFFICE_EXECUTABLE`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Optional explicit path to the soffice / libreoffice binary used by the "
"workbook-parity scanner. When None the scanner resolves it from PATH."
msgstr ""
"Ruta explícita opcional al binario soffice / libreoffice que usa el escáner "
"de paridad de libros de cálculo. Cuando es None, el escáner lo resuelve "
"desde PATH."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_LIVE_FILED_REGISTER_WALK_TIMEOUT_MS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_LIVE_FILED_REGISTER_WALK_TIMEOUT_MS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Timeout (ms) for one AEAT filed-declaration register query for a single "
"modelo/year. Bulk filed-history reads use this per-query budget so one slow "
"modelo cannot block all later modelos from returning typed failures."
msgstr ""
"Tiempo de espera (ms) para una consulta al registro de declaraciones "
"presentadas de la AEAT para un solo modelo/año. Las lecturas masivas del "
"historial de presentaciones usan este presupuesto por consulta para que un "
"modelo lento no impida que los modelos posteriores devuelvan fallos tipados."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_LIVE_IVA_CANCELLATION_DRAIN_MS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_LIVE_IVA_CANCELLATION_DRAIN_MS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`250`"
msgstr "`250`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Drain delay (ms) after a bounded live IVA read surface is cancelled, giving "
"Playwright browser tasks time to report cancellation-only errors before the "
"loop handler is restored."
msgstr ""
"Retardo de drenaje (ms) tras cancelar una superficie de lectura de IVA en "
"vivo acotada, que da a las tareas del navegador de Playwright tiempo para "
"informar de errores solo de cancelación antes de restaurar el manejador del "
"bucle."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_LIVE_IVA_CLI_WATCHDOG_TIMEOUT_MS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_LIVE_IVA_CLI_WATCHDOG_TIMEOUT_MS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`240000`"
msgstr "`240000`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Top-level CLI watchdog timeout (ms) for the combined read-only IVA remote-"
"state command. This must exceed the normal auth and surface budgets but "
"remain below operator shell/tool timeouts so the CLI can cancel and clean up"
" inside its own process."
msgstr ""
"Tiempo de espera del watchdog de nivel superior de la CLI (ms) para el "
"comando combinado de estado remoto de IVA de solo lectura. Debe superar los "
"presupuestos normales de autenticación y de superficie, pero mantenerse por "
"debajo de los tiempos de espera del shell/herramienta del operador para que "
"la CLI pueda cancelar y limpiar dentro de tu propio proceso."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_LIVE_IVA_DECLARATION_CAPTURE_TIMEOUT_MS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_LIVE_IVA_DECLARATION_CAPTURE_TIMEOUT_MS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Timeout (ms) for one Modelo 303 filed-declaration observation inside a "
"combined live IVA filed-history read. Must be lower than the outer live IVA "
"surface timeout so partial filed-history failures can return a structured "
"report before the whole surface is cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Tiempo de espera (ms) para una observación de declaración presentada del "
"modelo 303 dentro de una lectura combinada del historial de presentaciones "
"de IVA en vivo. Debe ser inferior al tiempo de espera de la superficie "
"exterior de IVA en vivo para que los fallos parciales del historial de "
"presentaciones puedan devolver un informe estructurado antes de que se "
"cancela toda la superficie."

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`CADRUMO_LIVE_IVA_SURFACE_TIMEOUT_MS`"
msgstr "`CADRUMO_LIVE_IVA_SURFACE_TIMEOUT_MS`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid "`180000`"
msgstr "`180000`"

#: ../../reference/environment-overrides.md
msgid ""
"Outer timeout (ms) for each live IVA read surface inside a combined remote-"
"state acquisition. Individual browser stages have their own shorter "
"timeouts; this bounds the whole filed-history or wallet/cartera surface."
msgstr ""
"Tiempo de espera exterior (ms) para cada superficie de lectura de IVA en "
"vivo dentro de una adquisición combinada de estado remoto. Las etapas "
"individuales del navegador tienen tus propios tiempos de espera más cortos; "
"este acota toda la superficie del historial de presentaciones o de la "
"cartera."

